# Virtual environment
venv/

# API keys - never push this
.env

# Raw source files - too large for GitHub (161MB)
# Kept in Google Drive instead
# ignore data cleaned also
data/raw/*
!data/raw/README.md
data/cleaned/
# Chunked text (CC BY-NC-SA source text, regenerated by notebook 02)
data/chunks/
# The same licensed chunk text, frozen for notebook 04. contexts_manifest.json is the committable record.
evaluation/notebook04/contexts.json
# Notebook 04 answer and judge caches (model answers quote the licensed excerpts) and freeze backups (contain contexts.json).
evaluation/notebook04/raw/
evaluation/notebook04/judge/
evaluation/notebook04/backups/
# Local results whose model answers quote licensed chunk text verbatim (author's decision, 2026-11-16): kept local only.
evaluation/notebook04/guardrail_review_llama3.2_3b.md
evaluation/baselines/baseline_llama3.2_3b_new_prompt.json
